      "<div class=\"news-detail-inline-image-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/berita/press-release-kegiatan-upgrading-peer-counselor-2025/foto-5.jpg\" alt=\"Press Release: Kegiatan Upgrading Peer Counselor 2025\" class=\"news-detail-inline-image\" /></div>",
